  status_note = 'PL-TRIAGE-1 rejected (session-old-issues-6d-2038, 2026-10-26; paper-convention): a hard ''ship falsification criteria'' gate on every pipeline paper rests on a keyword proxy: 531 of 706 published papers (75%) already contain falsif* in the body (living-paper, 2026-10-26), and the independent reviewer and second-family verify read content (ENSEMBLE-POLICY-1, probe ok). OUTPUT-QUALITY-LEDGER-1 says a rule-based score is a proxy, never a target, and migrations/2026-10-20-paper-learn-triage.sql rejected the same gate for learnings 17 and 48. Re-propose with a measured defect of unfalsifiable published papers.'
WHERE id = 776 AND fleet_status = 'proposed' AND applicability = 'direct';
