  status_note = 'PL-TRIAGE-1 rejected (session-old-issues-6d-2038, 2026-10-26; analogy-only): the lambda-weighted ERS gap is the paper''s own scoring formula; the fleet has no tunable weighted composite whose weights are changed: budget steering is a categorical rule (cheapest capable model at a cap) and reviewer layers are counted votes (ENSEMBLE-POLICY-1). A pre-change ranking-stability check has nothing to attach to. Re-propose when a weighted score is introduced.'
WHERE id = 849 AND fleet_status = 'proposed' AND applicability = 'direct';
