  'a paper learning is a lead; a single model saying apply does not settle it, a session that reads it against the repository and qnfo-audit does',
  'PAPER-LEARN-SESSION-TRIAGE-1: settle the 21 proposed direct learnings of issues 100311, 100319, 100325, 100338, 100353 (3 in place, 16 rejected with evidence, 2 routed to issues 1000459 and 1000043); add three catalogue mechanisms',
  'qnfo-audit 2026-10-26 read-only: code_tasks since 2026-10-12 (4+ attempts merged 24 of 89, 7+ merged 4 of 40), metric_registry (remedy_efficacy_30d 0.6, workers_ai_cost_30d_usd 299.84, monthly_cost_run_rate_usd 1466.84), decision_log (862 of 894 with predicted_outcome), living-paper (531 of 706 papers contain falsif*, 438 contain projection), issue_lifecycle (135 close-then-reopen pairs in 7 days), 118 guard metrics',
  'migration merged',
  'paper_learnings.fleet_status and status_note of 21 rows (copied to bak_20261026_paper_learnings); three paper_learning_mechanisms rows; one appended line on issue 1000043',
  'the Rollback header of migrations/2026-10-26-paper-learn-session-triage.sql',
  'proposed paper learnings that one model marked apply are settled with evidence, so the five oldest PAPER-LEARN-1 issues close and the PL_ISSUE_OPEN_MAX cap stops blocking later papers',
  'the five issues close at the next remediation tick (closing probe: no direct proposed learning of the paper and version), and two real gaps (reopen churn, spend-feed cross-check) each have an owner and a probe',
  'none',
  'd1:qnfo-audit and living-paper read-only, node:sqlite replay in migrations/paper-learn-session-triage.test.mjs'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM decision_log WHERE action LIKE 'PAPER-LEARN-SESSION-TRIAGE-1:%');
